 "remarks": "Hidden jewel in a convenient West Norwalk location near the Post Road and Darien. Uniquely situated in a single-family zone. Featuring townhouse living, three bedrooms, 2.5 baths, attached garage, and over 1,400 square feet, not including the full, two-room basement with over 600 square feet. The dining and living rooms overlook a private patio in back. The complex features a sunny pool and ample green space. Oak Hills, a public facility with golf and tennis, is nearby, as well as Costco, Home Depot, restaurants, and five grocery stores.",
